  "paper": "paper_1a",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A ray of monochromatic light is incident on the parallel interfaces between three media. The speeds of light in the media are v<sub>1</sub>, v<sub>2</sub> and v<sub>3</sub>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is correct about the speeds of light in the media?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">v<sub>3</sub> &lt; v<sub>1</sub> &lt; v<sub>2</sub></li><li data-label=\"B\">v<sub>3</sub> &lt; v<sub>2</sub> &lt; v<sub>1</sub></li><li data-label=\"C\">v<sub>2</sub> &lt; v<sub>3</sub> &lt; v<sub>1</sub></li><li data-label=\"D\">v<sub>2</sub> &lt; v<sub>1</sub> &lt; v<sub>3</sub></li></ol>"
  },
